 技能）\n目标：让“自主智能式工作”感觉像一个产品，而不是一个终端。","tags":["opencode","人工智能","大语言模型","智能体","自主智能"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://openwork.software/","releaseDate":"2026-02-10","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/different-ai/openwork/releases/tag/v0.11.46","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.46/DifferentAI.OpenWork.yaml","sha256":"9032c890938ed4647fa26d4ebbd82d4b1cbf9f4f3fe2a055d39a95603b49db00"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.46/DifferentAI.OpenWork.installer.yaml","sha256":"aa0ee07fc0694e140dd8d754fd38f7f1de741d8e668584ce8a94bf9ef178792a"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.46/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"daf4225bb593b2769ea510070157600c99eaae36456283a53c54c4e10447f7e6"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.46/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"ae254f49831c7bacc9948010f2397dd93e032b2e26966290a505b85c7cc742d6"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.11.46"}